The polling loop in asyncband/src/blocking/mod.rs is adapted from Pollster 1.0.1
at commit 6a1a148208326e9c5b231b16f199f5227c550774. Its reuse of a thread-local
Parker/Waker pair, with a fresh pair for recursive calls, is adapted from
futures-lite 2.6.1 at commit 226ce18976d8714d6bd9700b61dcc81d7200bc9a.
Pollster is available from https://github.com/zesterer/pollster and is
licensed under Apache-2.0 or MIT:

  Copyright (c) 2020-2021 Joshua Barretto

futures-lite is available from https://github.com/smol-rs/futures-lite and is
licensed under Apache-2.0 or MIT.

